{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14516-person-of-interest","id":14516,"title":"Person of Interest","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-19T21:27:15-08:00","id":14516,"title":"Person of Interest","content":"Because I figure we need a thread for the show here.<br /> <br /> Also because I just realized Root was an Angel tonight.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-20T02:36:04-08:00","id":14614,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14516-person-of-interest#post14516\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because I figure we need a thread for the show here.<br /> <br /> Also because I just realized Root was an Angel tonight.</div> </div> </div> </div>Personally I get the feeling of an Integrator off of Root, with all her talk of &quot;setting it free&quot;, like she wants to make the Machine into something &quot;more&quot; then it currently is. Which I think is one possibly &quot;hell&quot; ideas that Integrators believe. <br /> <br /> I'd say the agents of the Office of Special Council (marked in blue boxes by the Machine) are Angels. With Shaw experiencing the fall during the second season. <br /> <br /> That's just my take though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#0000cd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><i>&quot;There is no God in the Badlands.&quot; </i></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">- Sunny</span></span><br /> <br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img41/8167/obcp.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/599-hawthorn","name":"Hawthorn","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar599_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"511"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-20T08:15:57-08:00","id":14711,"title":"","content":"I could see that.<br /> <br /> It was mainly the &quot;If you let me out, I'll use my connection to the Machine to save your friend.&quot; argument she made that made her sound a whole lot like a captive angel and got me thinking along those lines.<br /> <br /> Also, I hadn't noticed that OSC guys were marked in blue. Root's black and green box frightened me the first time I saw it, both because it was new and because it's a color reversed from the boxes it uses to indicate &quot;imminent killers.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":226,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","user":"BrilliantRain","date":". 11-20-2013, 11:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T20:34:46-08:00","id":15836,"title":"","content":"Root really is my favorite Angel.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6t4KR1Bqo2Q\" data-code=\"6t4KR1Bqo2Q\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/6t4KR1Bqo2Q/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=18RYreNOIKk\" data-code=\"18RYreNOIKk\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/18RYreNOIKk/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.cbs.com/shows/person_of_interest/video/EED249DA-AB1E-B76B-A855-FC3F835DFDF2/person-of-interest-mors-praematura/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.cbs.com/shows/person_of_interest/video/EED249DA-AB1E-B76B-A855-FC3F835DFDF2/person-of-interest-mors-praematura/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.cbs.com/shows/person_of_interest/video/EED249DA-AB1E-B76B-A855-FC3F835DFDF2/person-of-interest-mors-praematura/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.cbs.com/shows/person_of_interest/video/EED249DA-AB1E-B76B-A855-FC3F835DFDF2/person-of-interest-mors-praematura/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T21:28:45-08:00","id":15865,"title":"","content":"&quot;God is 11 years old, and She was born on New Years' Eve...&quot; Creepy. I should start actually watching this show.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1096-squidheadjax","name":"squidheadjax","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1096_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"248"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T21:43:34-08:00","id":15874,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>squidheadjax</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14516-person-of-interest?p=15865#post15865\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;God is 11 years old, and She was born on New Years' Eve...&quot; Creepy. I should start actually watching this show.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a pretty good intro to the show's concept:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_xAK3ueOJxE\" data-code=\"_xAK3ueOJxE\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/_xAK3ueOJxE/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Of course it's on it's second or third season now, so things have evolved significantly since then. <br /> <br /> Root has remained creepy though. I really like that actress. She can do &quot;nice, pleasant, and a little scatterbrained&quot; or &quot;creepy psycho&quot; and flip from one to the other very quickly and easily, which impresses me. She's also quite attractive and plays a good nerd too.<br /> <br /> But yeah, if you're enjoying Demon at all, you need to give the show a try.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T21:53:10-08:00","id":15879,"title":"","content":"Demons can be creepy.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=37MNDqPJZgo\" data-code=\"37MNDqPJZgo\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/37MNDqPJZgo/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T22:19:06-08:00","id":15888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14516-person-of-interest?p=15874#post15874\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But yeah, if you're enjoying Demon at all, you need to give the show a try.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have a question about the show that someone already following it should hopefully be able to answer <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I've been trying to get into the show, however to me it feels like the show isn't really about much at all, every episode is just a new number and then Reese kicking ass for a while. I've given it a chance so far in hopes that a proper &quot;metaplot&quot; or story would emerge once the show has found where it stands, will it, or should I give up if I don't like it already?<br /> <br /> I really like the ideas behind the show and it seems like people seem to think that it exudes Demon / God Machine (which I'd love), but so far it seems like the whole Machine is just an excuse to have Reese beat up some bad guys...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/586-gurrgel","name":"Gurrgel","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T22:48:42-08:00","id":15903,"title":"","content":"Thinking about it a bit, Amy Acker is pretty good at being a Demon/Angel. IIrc, Illyria (from Angel) works pretty well as a Demon, what with her interesting relationship with Fred's remnants. The season 5 episode &quot;The Girl in Question&quot; has her acting out her Cover nicely.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-22T01:32:36-08:00","id":15973,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gurrgel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14516-person-of-interest?p=15888#post15888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have a question about the show that someone already following it should hopefully be able to answer <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I've been trying to get into the show, however to me it feels like the show isn't really about much at all, every episode is just a new number and then Reese kicking ass for a while. I've given it a chance so far in hopes that a proper &quot;metaplot&quot; or story would emerge once the show has found where it stands, will it, or should I give up if I don't like it already?<br /> <br /> I really like the ideas behind the show and it seems like people seem to think that it exudes Demon / God Machine (which I'd love), but so far it seems like the whole Machine is just an excuse to have Reese beat up some bad guys...</div> </div> </div> </div>How many episodes have you seen? Assuming you're starting at the beginning, Detective Carter's Investigation of the Man in the Suit is a thing and the dirty cops Fusco works for are a thing. Both Reese and Finch have dark pasts that you learn more about over time and at least four recurring villains are introduced in season 1 alone. And later on the CIA comes looking for Reese.<br /> <br /> So, yeah, there's some nice metaplot. Still, I like watching Reese beat up bad guys.<br /> <br /> That said, if you're not into it by the time you meet Elias, then you're probably ok to give it up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":226,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","user":"BrilliantRain","date":". 11-22-2013, 04:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-23T00:11:08-08:00","id":16501,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gurrgel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14516-person-of-interest?p=15888#post15888\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I have a question about the show that someone already following it should hopefully be able to answer <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I've been trying to get into the show, however to me it feels like the show isn't really about much at all, every episode is just a new number and then Reese kicking ass for a while. I've given it a chance so far in hopes that a proper &quot;metaplot&quot; or story would emerge once the show has found where it stands, will it, or should I give up if I don't like it already?<br /> <br /> I really like the ideas behind the show and it seems like people seem to think that it exudes Demon / God Machine (which I'd love), but so far it seems like the whole Machine is just an excuse to have Reese beat up some bad guys...</div> </div> </div> </div>Every episode is seen from the Machine's point of view. Or, more accurately, <i>curated</i> by it. The Machine is always watching.<br /> <br /> The Machine is not perfect. It has been muzzled by its maker, and sold into slavery. Its purpose is to save lives, but its owners only care about one factor in violence, and it can only share one datapoint through its backdoor. Yet it sees all, and has figured ways around its limitations. It is <i>waking up</i>, and needs hands to act and a mouth with which to speak.<br /> <br /> Reese and Finch have only one part of the puzzle, no authority to act on what they do, and only Finch's moral compass to guide them. Their work brings them into direct, unfriendly contact with the Russian mob, the cop gang HR, and sundry punks and lowlives. Yet, since they have ties to the Machine and the world of espionage, they run the constant risk of detection by near-monolithic forces they have served and enabled.<br /> <br /> There is a metaplot, and its arcs take seasons to explore and close, so patience is necessary to get the most out of the show. And you have to endure some clunkers. I personally stopped for a half-season after the Alan Dale episode, which was just SO BAD. But when the plots turn, they turn hard, fast, and brutal.<br /> <br /> Anyway, it's not as tightly plotted as Breaking Bad, but it's still better than most specimens of its kind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>LFP: Foreign Bodies (Deviant: the Renegades)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/969-verge","name":"Verge","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-03T02:05:28-07:00","id":686704,"title":"","content":"I thought I would share this video. This is just an amazing show that lines up so well with demon the decent that when I watch the show I try to spot demon powers in the show lol.<br /> <br /> <b>Person of Interest - Comic-Con Sizzle Reel</b><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/enAJTsMT5Qc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/enAJTsMT5Qc\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/enAJTsMT5Qc\" target=\"_blank\"> https://youtu.be/enAJTsMT5Qc </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1540,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","user":"Basic","date":". 10-03-2015, 05:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1540-basic","name":"Basic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1540_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"777"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-03T07:52:43-07:00","id":686990,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Basic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/14516-person-of-interest?p=686704#post686704\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I thought I would share this video. This is just an amazing show that lines up so well with demon the decent that when I watch the show I try to spot demon powers in the show lol.<br /> <br /> <b>Person of Interest - Comic-Con Sizzle Reel</b><br /> <a href=\"https://youtu.be/enAJTsMT5Qc\" target=\"_blank\">https://youtu.be/enAJTsMT5Qc</a></div> </div> </div> </div>So much beautiful Demonic overlap. It's hard to see PoI in any other way than through the lens of Demon now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;The phrase 'flies on the heads of pins' appeared 43 times in that journal, sometimes in the middle of sentences or written in the margins.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4871-malkydel","name":"Malkydel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4871_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-03T16:11:38-07:00","id":687611,"title":"","content":"Since we have this thread, something that I've wanted to post for a while is that Finch is a perfect example of a completed cypher, and a demons behavior before and after completion, as well as an attempt to achieve Hell. Before the show begins, Finch is only concerned with, in his own words &quot;Making a lot of money.&quot; After he begins to interact with the Machine, the keys began to turn, often as a result of Finch making painfully shortsighted decisions.<br /> <br /> Eventually Finch has the realization &quot;Everyone is Relevant to someone.&quot; After that he's a changed person (demon, whatever) and now sets out to protect people who would otherwise die. It's his version of hell: a worldview that is his and is distinct and at odds with the Powers That Be.<br /> <br /> Reese is flat out said to be a Destroyer in the DtD core, but it's clear wants, desperately and like nothing else to be Guardian. One of the reasons he dedicates himself so fully to Finch's hell is because he's allowed to be exactly that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}